---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const itemSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Kids Hot Dog Meal",
      "image": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/Images/kids-hot-dog-meal.webp",
      "description": "A Classic Hot Dog on a steamed bun, Fries or Applesauce, Milk or Soft Drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone. The simplest, most familiar Kids Meal at $4.99.",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "4.99",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "availability": "https://schema.org/InStock",
        "url": "https://www.thequeendairymenu.us/items/kids-hot-dog-meal"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much is the DQ Kids Hot Dog Meal?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "$4.99 — includes the entrée, Fries or Applesauce, Milk or Soft Drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is the Vanilla Soft Serve Cone really free in the Kids Meal?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. The Vanilla Soft Serve Cone (normally $2.39) is included in every DQ Kids Meal at no extra charge within the $4.99 price."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the healthiest DQ Kids Meal choice?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Choose Applesauce instead of Fries and 1% Milk instead of Soft Drink to get the lowest-calorie, most nutritionally balanced Kids Meal."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout title="Dairy Queen Kids Hot Dog Meal — Price 2026" description="DQ Kids Hot Dog Meal: $4.99, includes a Classic Hot Dog, Fries or Applesauce, Milk or Drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone. Great for picky eaters.">
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(itemSchema)} />


<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="breadcrumb"><div class="container"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/#full-menu">Menu</a></li><li><a href="/categories/kids-meals">Kids Meals</a></li><li aria-current="page">Kids Hot Dog Meal</li></ol></div></nav>

<div class="container">
  <div class="item-hero">
    <div class="item-media">
      <img src="/Images/kids-hot-dog-meal.webp" alt="Kids Hot Dog Meal — Dairy Queen 2026 menu item" width="600" height="450" loading="eager">
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="badge-row"><span class="badge red">Complete Kids Meal</span><span class="badge">Cone Included</span><span class="badge blue">$4.99 Total</span></div>
      <h1>Kids Hot Dog Meal</h1>
      <div class="item-price-lg">$4.99</div>
      <p>A classic all-beef frankfurter served on a warm, pillowy steamed bun, accompanied by crispy french fries or natural Mott's® applesauce, a choice of low-fat milk or beverage, plus a hand-swirled vanilla soft serve cone for dessert. The quintessential hassle-free kids meal for just $4.99.</p>

      <table class="spec-table"><tbody><tr><td>Price</td><td>$4.99 — complete meal</td></tr><tr><td>Entrée</td><td>All-beef Classic Hot Dog on a steamed bun</td></tr><tr><td>Side</td><td>Regular Fries OR Applesauce</td></tr><tr><td>Drink</td><td>1% Low-Fat Milk OR Soft Drink</td></tr><tr><td>Dessert</td><td>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone — included</td></tr></tbody></table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Price &amp; Calories — 2026</h2>
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Size / Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Total Fat</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Kids Meal (all options)</strong></td><td>$4.99</td><td class="price-cell">~670–880 cal</td><td>Entrée + side + drink + cone</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    </div>
    <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Prices are 2026 national averages. Local DQ prices may vary.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container article-body" style="max-width:920px;">
    <h2>The Go-To Option for Fussy Eaters</h2>
  <p>When dealing with picky appetites or young toddlers overwhelmed by complex toppings, Dairy Queen's Kids Hot Dog Meal offers pure, straightforward comfort. Sourced from 100% seasoned beef and served plain in an ultra-soft bun with condiment packets provided on the side, it gives parents total control over preparation:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Entrée:</strong> All-beef grilled frank on a tender steamed bakery bun</li>
        <li><strong>Side Choice:</strong> Golden hot french fries (~260 cal) or chilled unsweetened applesauce (~50 cal)</li>
        <li><strong>Drink Choice:</strong> Calcium-rich 1% low-fat milk carton or fountain soft drink</li>
        <li><strong>Dessert Included:</strong> Classic Vanilla Soft Serve Cone (~230 cal)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Explore all junior combinations on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a> or browse our dedicated <a href="/categories/kids-meals">Kids Meals section</a>.</p>

      <h2>All Three DQ Kids Meals</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Kids Meal</th><th>Price</th><th>Approx. Cal</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Kids Cheeseburger Meal</td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>~880 cal (fries+milk)</td><td>Most popular — classic burger choice</td></tr><tr><td>Kids 2-Pc Chicken Strips Meal</td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>~880 cal (fries+milk)</td><td>For chicken strip fans</td></tr><tr><td>Kids Hot Dog Meal</td><td class="price-cell">$4.99</td><td>~820 cal (fries+milk)</td><td>Simplest — great for picky eaters</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

      <h2>Making the Lighter Kids Meal Choice</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Choose <strong>Applesauce</strong> over Fries to save ~210 calories</li>
        <li>Choose <strong>1% Milk</strong> over Soft Drink for calcium and protein with no added sugar</li>
        <li>The <strong>Vanilla Soft Serve Cone</strong> is included in the $4.99 price — the same cone sold separately for $2.39</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>A Genuine $4.99 Value Triumph</h2>
      <p>Purchased à la carte at standard drive-thru pricing, an all-beef hot dog ($3.99), junior fries ($2.49), a carton of cold milk ($1.49), and a vanilla cone ($2.39) would total $10.36. Bundled together at just $4.99, it provides unmatched family affordability while guaranteeing every child leaves with a full belly and a smile.</p>

      <h2>Related Items</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/items/kids-cheeseburger-meal">Kids Cheeseburger Meal — $4.99</a></li>
        <li><a href="/items/vanilla-soft-serve-cone">Vanilla Soft Serve Cone (sold separately) — $2.39</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categories/kids-meals">All DQ Kids Meal Options</a></li>
        <li><a href="/items/7-meal-deal">$7 Meal Deal (for adults)</a></li>
      </ul>
    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-list"><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">How much is the DQ Kids Hot Dog Meal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">$4.99 — includes the entrée, Fries or Applesauce, Milk or Soft Drink, and a Vanilla Soft Serve Cone.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">Is the Vanilla Soft Serve Cone really free in the Kids Meal?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Yes. The Vanilla Soft Serve Cone (normally $2.39) is included in every DQ Kids Meal at no extra charge within the $4.99 price.</div></div>
    </div><div class="faq-item">
      <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">What is the healthiest DQ Kids Meal choice?<span class="faq-icon">+</span></button>
      <div class="faq-a"><div class="faq-a-inner">Choose Applesauce instead of Fries and 1% Milk instead of Soft Drink to get the lowest-calorie, most nutritionally balanced Kids Meal.</div></div>
    </div></div>
    <p style="margin-top:32px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);">
      For every DQ price, flavor, and category, visit <a href="/"><strong>The Queen Dairy Menu</strong></a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
